{"seq":2,"slug":"hnsw-graphs","title":"HNSW 图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/hnsw-graphs","wordCount":1709,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"hnsw-图索引\">HNSW 图索引</h1><p>把向量检索想象成在城市里找最近的咖啡馆：你不会挨家挨户问，而是先上高速干道大致靠近、再下匝道、最后在街区里步行微调。HNSW（Hierarchical Navigable Small World，分层可导航小世界）正是把这套「分层导航」搬进高维空间的索引，它是 2026 年绝大多数生产向量检索的事实默认——高召回、支持动态插入、查询复杂度近似对数级。代价是内存占用比 IVF 高，这也是后面讨论扩展时绕不开的话题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分层小世界图\">核心概念：分层小世界图</h2><p>HNSW 建立在两个想法上。其一是「小世界图」：每个向量是图上一个节点，连向若干近邻；只要图里既有短连边（精修）又有长连边（跨越），就能少数几跳从任意点走到任意点。其二是「分层」：把图分成多层，顶层稀疏只有少量节点和长边，越往下越密。查询从顶层入口贪心地向查询靠近，到某层走不动了就下沉一层继续，直到最底层（含全部节点）做精修。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[查询 q 从顶层入口进入] --&gt; B[本层贪心: 走向更近的邻居]&#10;    B --&gt; C{还能更近?}&#10;    C --&gt;|能| B&#10;    C --&gt;|不能| D{是最底层?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[下沉一层 继续贪心]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[用 efSearch 维护候选堆]&#10;    F --&gt; G[返回 top-k]\">flowchart TD\n    A[查询 q 从顶层入口进入] --&gt; B[本层贪心: 走向更近的邻居]\n    B --&gt; C{还能更近?}\n    C --&gt;|能| B\n    C --&gt;|不能| D{是最底层?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[下沉一层 继续贪心]\n    E --&gt; B\n    D --&gt;|是| F[用 efSearch 维护候选堆]\n    F --&gt; G[返回 top-k]</pre><p>这种结构让单次查询的距离计算量大致是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 级别，远优于 IVF 的「扫几个簇」，尤其在高召回区间优势明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个核心参数\">三个核心参数</h2><p>HNSW 的行为由三个旋钮决定，下表对照它们的含义与代价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>调大的效果</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每节点的最大连边数</td>\n<td>召回更高、图更稳健</td>\n<td>内存随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>construction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{construction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">construction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>建图时候选队列大小</td>\n<td>图质量更好、召回更高</td>\n<td>建索引更慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>search</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{search}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">search</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>查询时候选队列大小</td>\n<td>召回更高</td>\n<td>查询延迟更高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>construction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{construction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">construction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在建图时固定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>search</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{search}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">search</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可在每次查询时动态调整——这意味着同一个索引可以按业务对召回的要求即时改变延迟，是 HNSW 实践中最常用的运行时旋钮。内存方面，每节点要存约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>（底层约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>）个邻居 ID，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 越大图越占内存，这正是 HNSW 内存偏高的来源，细节见 <a href=\"../applications/scaling-performance\">扩展与性能</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么它成了默认\">为什么它成了默认</h2><p>相比 <a href=\"ivf-clustering\">倒排文件与聚类 IVF</a>，HNSW 有几个让它在 2026 年胜出的工程特性。它无需训练，向量逐条插入即可，天然适合数据持续增长的场景；它在同等召回下通常比 IVF 更快，因为图的长边能直接跨越空间而不受簇边界拖累；它对查询分布不敏感，不像 IVF 那样依赖 k-means 的簇是否贴合数据。一份 2026 年的基准里，Qdrant 用 HNSW 在一亿向量、95% 召回下做到了亚百毫秒的查询延迟。</p>\n<p>但它也有明确的软肋。删除是难点：图节点删掉会破坏连通性，多数实现用「软删除 + 标记」再后台重建。过滤是另一个软肋：当叠加元数据过滤时，HNSW 的贪心遍历会因为很多邻居被过滤掉而「无路可走」，尾延迟陡增甚至召回崩塌——这与 IVF 在过滤下延迟平稳形成鲜明对比，处理方式见 <a href=\"../systems/filtering-metadata\">元数据过滤与预后过滤</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存与磁盘的折中\">内存与磁盘的折中</h2><p>HNSW 的高内存占用在十亿级会变成硬墙：图结构加原始向量可能要几十上百 GB 全驻内存。两条主流缓解路径都在 2026 年成熟。其一是把 HNSW 与量化结合，用压缩向量算近似距离、再对少量候选用原始向量精排，既保召回又省内存，量化部分见 <a href=\"quantization\">量化：PQ 与 SQ</a>。其二是磁盘化的图索引（如 DiskANN 思路），把大部分图放 SSD、内存只留导航必需的部分，用一点延迟换数量级的容量。</p>\n<p>内存估算可以自己推：每条向量的裸数据是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 字节，图链路部分底层约存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个邻居 ID，若每个 ID 用 4 字节则约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 字节。于是内存大致正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot (4d + 8M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——这解释了为什么「加大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 提召回」的代价是内存线性上涨，而「降维或量化」动的是另一半。</p>\n<p>选 HNSW 还是 IVF，本质上是在「召回—延迟」与「内存—可过滤性」两组取舍间做选择：要极致召回与低延迟、数据动态增长、过滤不重，选 HNSW；要省内存、过滤密集、数据可批量重建，IVF（尤其 IVF-PQ）更合适。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见调参反模式\">常见调参反模式</h2><p>HNSW 的参数少，误用却很集中。下表把线上最常撞见的症状、根因与处置归拢成一张对照，便于出问题时快速定位。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回上不去</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>construction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{construction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">construction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 太小，图连通性差</td>\n<td>提高建图参数后整体重建，而非只调查询参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询延迟偏高</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>search</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{search}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">search</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设得过大</td>\n<td>在召回—延迟曲线上重找贴合 SLO 的工作点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存吃紧</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 大且未压缩</td>\n<td>叠加 <a href=\"quantization\">量化</a> 或走磁盘化图索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤查询尾延迟陡增</td>\n<td>图遍历被过滤掏空连通性</td>\n<td>用支持过滤中检索的库，见 <a href=\"../systems/filtering-metadata\">元数据过滤</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除后召回抖动</td>\n<td>软删除破坏图连通性</td>\n<td>减少高频删除，或定期重建，避免长期累积软删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最容易被误诊的是第一行：召回偏低时，很多人反复调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>search</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{search}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">search</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但若图本身建得不好（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>construction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{construction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">construction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不足、长边缺失），再怎么放大查询端候选也只是在一个连通性不佳的图上多走几步，收效有限且延迟白白变高。建图参数决定召回上限，查询参数只决定你在上限之内取哪个点——这个次序不能颠倒。</p>\n<p>另一类反模式是「先建小图再指望它长大」。HNSW 支持动态插入，但插入顺序与建图参数会共同决定图的质量；如果一开始用很小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 灌了海量数据，后期发现问题只能推倒重建，而重建十亿级索引本身就是一个需要专门规划的动作。所以建图参数应当在索引设计阶段就按目标召回定好，而不是等到线上暴露召回不足再回头补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>HNSW 用分层小世界图做导航式检索，查询近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>三旋钮 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>construction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{construction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">construction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>search</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ef_{\\text{search}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">search</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；后者可运行时调，即时换召回—延迟。</li>\n<li>相比 <a href=\"ivf-clustering\">IVF</a>：无需训练、动态插入、同召回更快，但内存更高、删除与过滤更难。</li>\n<li>过滤下尾延迟陡增，与 IVF 互补，详见 <a href=\"../systems/filtering-metadata\">元数据过滤</a>。</li>\n<li>大规模靠 <a href=\"quantization\">量化</a> 或磁盘图缓解内存，运维细节见 <a href=\"../applications/scaling-performance\">扩展与性能</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"HNSW 图索引","id":"hnsw-图索引"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分层小世界图","id":"核心概念-分层小世界图"},{"level":2,"text":"三个核心参数","id":"三个核心参数"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它成了默认","id":"为什么它成了默认"},{"level":2,"text":"内存与磁盘的折中","id":"内存与磁盘的折中"},{"level":2,"text":"常见调参反模式","id":"常见调参反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"倒排文件与聚类 IVF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/ivf-clustering"},"next":{"title":"量化：PQ 与 SQ","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/quantization"}}